WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.500
[Music]
Ion Storm. A field of moving filaments.

00:00:03.450 --> 00:00:06.400
The indigo field ripples between strikes.

00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:13.550
Bass changes the pace. Kicks trigger the bolts.

00:00:16.450 --> 00:00:19.450
The field keeps moving as the light fades.

00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:27.400
[Music continues]
